'''''Melilotus messanensis''''' is a species of annual herb in the family [[Fabaceae]]. They have a self-supporting growth form and compound, broad leaves.<ref>{{Cite web|title=Melilotus messanensis (L.)All. - Encyclopedia of Life|url=https://eol.org/pages/703295|access-date=2022-02-04|website=eol.org}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Mifsud |first=Stephen |date=2002-08-23 |title=Melilotus messanensis (Southern Melilot) : MaltaWildPlants.com - the online Flora of the Maltese Islands. |url=https://www.maltawildplants.com/FABC/Melilotus_messanensis.php |access-date=2022-03-05 |website=www.maltawildplants.com |language=en-us |archive-date=2021-12-27 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20211227180357/https://www.maltawildplants.com/FABC/Melilotus_messanensis.php |url-status=dead }}</ref>

